OL,4,T7#####################################k
OL,5,T5FMAJOR SAYS TORIES FACE TOUGH FIGHT Tj
OL,6,T5GJohn Major has admitted that the   Tj
OL,7,T5GTories will have to fight hard to  Tj
OL,8,T5Gwin May's local elections.         Tj
OL,9,T5F                                   Tj
OL,10,T5FAt the Conservatives' local        Tj
OL,11,T5Fgovernment conference in London he Tj
OL,12,T5Fsaid the party had taken "a fair   Tj
OL,13,T5Famount of stick", but urged party  Tj
OL,14,T5Fworkers to "go on the attack".     Tj
OL,15,T5                                     j
OL,16,T5F"We are not going to win if we stayTj
OL,17,T5Fon the back foot," he said. "We    Tj
OL,18,T5Fmust be positive. We must be       Tj
OL,19,T5Fconfident. We must be united."     Tj
OL,20,T5                                     j
