OL,5,T5FPLO RECALLS ITS PEACE NEGOTIATORS  Tj
OL,6,T5GThe PLO has said it is recalling   Tj
OL,7,T5Gnegotiators with Israel in Egypt,  Tj
OL,8,T5GParis and Washington because of theTj
OL,9,T5GHebron massacre by a Jewish settlerTj
OL,10,T5F                                   Tj
OL,11,T5FAnd senior Palestinian negotiator  Tj
OL,12,T5FNabil Shaath said Israel must startTj
OL,13,T5Fdisarmament of Jewish settlers and Tj
OL,14,T5Fact to protect Palestinians before Tj
OL,15,T5Fpeace negotiations resume.         Tj
OL,16,T5F                                   Tj
OL,17,T5FEarlier, Yasser Arafat said talks  Tj
OL,18,T5Fwith Israel had "lost credibility" Tj
OL,19,T5Ffollowing the massacre, in which atTj
OL,20,T5Fleast 48 people died.              Tj
OL,21,Tupppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppz
