OL,4,T7#####################################k
OL,5,T5FCIA MAN "DID SPY FOR THE RUSSIANS" Tj
OL,6,T5GA Russian general has effectively  Tj
OL,7,T5Gacknowledged that CIA veteran      Tj
OL,8,T5GAldrich Ames was working for MoscowTj
OL,9,T5F                                   Tj
OL,10,T5FLt-Gen Mikhail Kolesnikov, chief ofTj
OL,11,T5Fthe armed forces' general staff, isTj
OL,12,T5Fquoted by the Itar-Tass news agencyTj
OL,13,T5Fas saying:                         Tj
OL,14,T5F                                   Tj
OL,15,T5F"He defended our interests because Tj
OL,16,T5Fhe exposed spies who were pumping  Tj
OL,17,T5FRussian secrets to the US."        Tj
OL,18,T5F                                   Tj
OL,19,T5FMr Ames was arrested on Monday.    Tj
OL,20,T5FYesterday, Washington expelled     Tj
OL,21,T5Fa Russian diplomat.                Tj
