OL,5,T5FWACO SIEGE TRIAL VERDICT DUE SOON  Tj
OL,6,T5GThe jury in the Waco siege trial   Tj
OL,7,T5Gsays it has reached a decision and Tj
OL,8,T5Gwill deliver its verdict later thisTj
OL,9,T5Gevening.                           Tj
OL,10,T5G                                   Tj
OL,11,T5FEleven Branch Davidian cult membersTj
OL,12,T5Fare charged with the murder of fourTj
OL,13,T5FFBI agents during a shoot-out in   Tj
OL,14,T5FWaco last February.                Tj
OL,15,T5F                                   Tj
OL,16,T5FThe verdict will come after four   Tj
OL,17,T5Fdays of deliberations, just two    Tj
OL,18,T5Fdays before the first anniversary  Tj
OL,19,T5Fof the ending of the siege.        Tj
OL,20,T5F                                   Tj
OL,21,T5F                                   Tj
